    "description": "CFSRS is a 1:1 asset-backed token collateralized by the Cayman Fund: Stable Return SP. The investment objective of the fund is to seek a stable return over a mid-to-long-term investment horizon. The fund will primarily invest in debt securities issued by governments, government and public agencies, financial institutions, supra-nationals and corporate issuers in international fixed income markets. Debt securities include but are not limited to convertible, exchangeable and non-exchangeable and non-convertible debt securities, fixed and floating rate bonds, zero-coupon and discount bonds, credit-linked notes with or without callable/puttable features, commercial papers, certificates of deposits, as well as short-term bills and notes. Redemption process: Holders redeem via https://asseto.finance/product with a $100k minimum.",
